"Soft Kitty."

12
00:00:40,261 --> 00:00:45,601
(Mrs Cooper:)Soft kitty, warm kitty, little ball of fur

13
00:00:45,767 --> 00:00:48,357
- Were we supposed to take that pie out?
- Get out!

14
00:00:51,231 --> 00:00:52,481
(Mrs Cooper:)Well, that was rude.

15
00:00:52,649 --> 00:00:55,489
